.TH VKQ3NG 6 "October 2026" "vkq3ng 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vkq3ng \- Vulkan Quake 3 Next Generation engine with ray tracing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vkq3ng
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vkq3ng
is the Vulkan Quake 3 Next Generation game engine featuring a modern
Vulkan renderer with ray-tracing support, Wayland native backend,
SDL2 audio, and FSR-style render scaling.

This is the engine only - you must provide your own Quake III Arena
game data (baseq3/pak0.pk3 through pak8.pk3).
.SH OPTIONS
The engine accepts all standard Quake III Arena command-line options.
Common options include:

.TP
\fB+set fs_basepath \fIpath\fR
Set the base installation path (read-only game data).
.TP
\fB+set fs_homepath \fIpath\fR
Set the user home path (writable config, mods, screenshots).
.TP
\fB+set fs_game \fIname\fR
Set the game directory (mod name, e.g. "baseq3", "missionpack").
.TP
\fB+set r_renderer \fIrenderer\fR
Select renderer: "vk" (Vulkan, default), "vk_rt" (Vulkan ray-tracing).
.TP
\fB+set r_gpuIndex \fIindex\fR
Select GPU by index (0 = first).
.TP
\fB+set r_rayTracing \fI0|1\fR
Enable/disable ray-tracing (requires RTX-class hardware).
.TP
\fB+set r_fsrScale \fIvalue\fR
Render scale factor for FSR-style upscaling (0.5-1.0).
.TP
\fB+set r_wayland \fI0|1\fR
Force Wayland (1) or X11 (0) backend.
.TP
\fB+set com_ansiColor \fI0|1\fR
Enable/disable ANSI color in console output.
.TP
\fB+set developer \fI0|1|2\fR
Developer mode verbosity.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI/usr/share/games/vkq3ng/baseq3/\fR
System-wide game data directory (read-only). Place retail pak files here.
.TP
\fI~/.vkq3ng/\fR
User home directory (writable). Contains config, mods, demos, screenshots.
.TP
\fI/usr/lib/vkq3ng/\fR
Engine libraries (cgame, qagame, ui modules).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBVK_ICD_FILENAMES\fR
Override Vulkan ICD path.
.TP
\fBWAYLAND_DISPLAY\fR
Wayland display to connect to.
.TP
\fBDISPLAY\fR
X11 display to connect to (fallback).
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Start with retail data in system location:
.B vkq3ng
.TP
Start with data in custom location:
.B vkq3ng +set fs_basepath /mnt/games/quake3
.TP
Start dedicated server:
.B vkq3ng-server +set dedicated 2 +set net_port 27960 +exec server.cfg
.TP
Benchmark with Vulkan ray-tracing:
.B vkq3ng +set r_renderer vk_rt +set r_rayTracing 1 +set timedemo 1 +demo demo1
